  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Crackers_Wither_Storm_Performance/BH_CWSP_header.webp\" alt=\"橫幅標題\">\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftinyurl.com%252famy67484\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Crackers_Wither_Storm_Performance/BH_CWSP_promo.webp\" alt=\"Bisecthosting 廣告橫幅\"></a></p><h2><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Crackers_Wither_Storm_Performance/BH_CWSP_overview.webp\" alt=\"概覽橫幅\"></h2><p><strong>Cracker's Wither Storm Performance</strong> 是一個以凋零風暴模組為核心的效能優化整合包。專為讓玩家享受精彩的首領戰鬥而設計，無需擔心效能問題。想要更炫酷的體驗？在與這個超過100方塊大小的怪物戰鬥時，使用你喜愛的著色器吧！</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/crackers-wither-storm-performance\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmodpack%252fcrackers-wither-storm-performance\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fkesselot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/kofi-plural-alt_vector.svg\" alt=\"Ko-fi 贊助\"></a></p><h1>特色功能</h1><ul>\n<li>[✔️] <strong>全面優化</strong> - 開箱即用，支援著色器。</li>\n<li>[✔️] <strong>Cracker's Wither Storm</strong> - 一個巨大方塊組成的怪物！準備好挑戰吧。</li>\n</ul><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/N8tUm6N4Qc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Crackers_Wither_Storm_Performance/BH_CWSP_discord.webp\" alt=\"Discord 橫幅\"></a></p><h3>整合包備註</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>如果你是遊玩此整合包的 YouTuber 或內容創作者，請在影片描述中附上返回此頁面的連結，讓觀眾知道你所使用的整合包。</strong></li>\n<li><strong>不允許在 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 上重新上傳此整合包或其任何修改版本，亦不得轉發至任何其他網站。</strong>（<em>除非獲得我本人的明確許可</em>）</li>\n</ul>",
